<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Saib upgraded at Lehman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Saib upgraded at Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian engineering group Sasib Spa was raised to &quot;outperform&quot; from &quot;neutral&quot; at Lehman Brothers, a research note from analyst Chris Heminway at the brokerage said on Monday.</p>
<p>Heminway said it was one of the cheapest stocks in the sector and set a price target of 6,100 lire for the company's ordinary shares.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
